{"id":"u9l3605nwfowcip8lnottzrsm","title":"《岩岸》：控制论与存在主义的边界共存","originalTitle":"我与AI的诗歌翻译对比59. 一首哲学意味浓厚的诗（2010）","summary":"这首诗探讨了在坚硬与包容的边界上，个体如何既不被消解也不被孤立的完整存在状态。从控制论视角看，它强调人与环境互不损耗的共生；从存在主义角度看，主体在岩与水的交界处同时拥有独立身份和融入体验，达成不被任何一方撕裂的完整存在。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=1557&do=blog&id=1560780"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T02:54:41.489Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T02:54:41.489Z","category":"ai-frontier","tags":["论文发表","研究成果"],"score":18,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}